## 🎯 Quick Reference

### Project Structure
```
lib/
├── core/          # Theme, constants, utils, models
├── widgets/       # Reusable UI components
└── features/      # Feature modules (player_registration, breathalyzer, etc.)
```

### Key Commands
```bash
dart run build_runner build -d    # Generate code
dart format .                     # Format code
flutter analyze                   # Static analysis
flutter test                      # Run tests
```

### DGT Color Palette
- Primary: `Color(0xFF003DA5)` (DGT Blue)
- Warning: `Color(0xFFFFC107)` (Traffic Yellow)
- Danger: `Color(0xFFD32F2F)` (Violation Red)
- Success: `Color(0xFF388E3C)` (Safe Green)

